  {
    "element_type": "heading",
    "text": "1.​Overview",
    "page": 3,
    "heading_level": 2,
    "heading_path": [
      "COMPANY PROFILE",
      "1.​Overview"
    ],
    "metadata": {
      "extraction_method": "pymupdf",
      "font_size": 15.0,
      "bold": true
    }
  },
  {
    "element_type": "paragraph",
    "text": "Terra (marketed to end users as Scent Plus) is a mobile companion application built to automate the",
    "page": 3,
    "heading_level": null,
    "heading_path": [
      "COMPANY PROFILE",
      "1.​Overview"
    ],
    "metadata": {
      "extraction_method": "pymupdf"
    }
  },
  {
    "element_type": "paragraph",
    "text": "setup, scheduling, and monitoring of Wi-Fi-connected scent and fragrance dispenser devices for home",
    "page": 3,
    "heading_level": null,
    "heading_path": [
      "COMPANY PROFILE",
      "1.​Overview"
    ],
    "metadata": {
      "extraction_method": "pymupdf"
    }
  },
  {
    "element_type": "paragraph",
    "text": "and business use.",
    "page": 3,
    "heading_level": null,
    "heading_path": [
      "COMPANY PROFILE",
      "1.​Overview"
    ],
    "metadata": {
      "extraction_method": "pymupdf"
    }
  },
  {
    "element_type": "paragraph",
    "text": "The application gives users a single, mobile-first workspace to bring a new device onto their home network,",
    "page": 3,
    "heading_level": null,
    "heading_path": [
      "COMPANY PROFILE",
      "1.​Overview"
    ],
    "metadata": {
      "extraction_method": "pymupdf"
    }
  },
  {
    "element_type": "paragraph",
    "text": "configure a spraying schedule, monitor device status, and keep firmware up to date — all from one phone,",
    "page": 3,
    "heading_level": null,
    "heading_path": [
      "COMPANY PROFILE",
      "1.​Overview"
    ],
    "metadata": {
      "extraction_method": "pymupdf"
    }
  },
  {
    "element_type": "paragraph",
    "text": "with no separate hub, screen, or PC required.",
    "page": 3,
    "heading_level": null,
    "heading_path": [
      "COMPANY PROFILE",
      "1.​Overview"
    ],
    "metadata": {
      "extraction_method": "pymupdf"
    }
  },
  {
    "element_type": "heading",
    "text": "2.​Business Context",
    "page": 3,
    "heading_level": 2,
    "heading_path": [
      "COMPANY PROFILE",
      "2.​Business Context"
    ],
    "metadata": {
      "extraction_method": "pymupdf",
      "font_size": 15.0,
      "bold": true
    }
  },
  {
    "element_type": "paragraph",
    "text": "Organizations and consumers deploying screenless smart-home devices typically need to:",
    "page": 3,
    "heading_level": null,
    "heading_path": [
      "COMPANY PROFILE",
      "2.​Business Context"
    ],
    "metadata": {
      "extraction_method": "pymupdf"
    }
  },
  {
    "element_type": "paragraph",
    "text": "•​ Onboard a new Wi-Fi device onto a home or business network without a direct physical connection",
    "page": 3,
    "heading_level": null,
    "heading_path": [
      "COMPANY PROFILE",
      "2.​Business Context"
    ],
    "metadata": {
      "extraction_method": "pymupdf"
    }
  },
  {
    "element_type": "paragraph",
    "text": "•​ Configure and adjust an operating schedule remotely, without buttons or a display on the device",
    "page": 3,
    "heading_level": null,
    "heading_path": [
      "COMPANY PROFILE",
      "2.​Business Context"
    ],
    "metadata": {
      "extraction_method": "pymupdf"
    }
  },
  {
    "element_type": "paragraph",
    "text": "•​ Monitor consumable levels, battery, and overall device health at a glance",
    "page": 3,
    "heading_level": null,
    "heading_path": [
      "COMPANY PROFILE",
      "2.​Business Context"
    ],
    "metadata": {
      "extraction_method": "pymupdf"
    }
  },
  {
    "element_type": "paragraph",
    "text": "•​ Keep device firmware current without returning the unit or connecting it to a computer",
    "page": 3,
    "heading_level": null,
    "heading_path": [
      "COMPANY PROFILE",
      "2.​Business Context"
    ],
    "metadata": {
      "extraction_method": "pymupdf"
    }
  },
  {
    "element_type": "paragraph",
    "text": "•​ Diagnose a lost connection quickly and get clear guidance to restore it",
    "page": 3,
    "heading_level": null,
    "heading_path": [
      "COMPANY PROFILE",
      "2.​Business Context"
    ],
    "metadata": {
      "extraction_method": "pymupdf"
    }
  },
  {
    "element_type": "paragraph",
    "text": "Handling this manually for screenless IoT hardware is cumbersome and inconsistent. Terra centralizes",
    "page": 3,
    "heading_level": null,
    "heading_path": [
      "COMPANY PROFILE",
      "2.​Business Context"
    ],
    "metadata": {
      "extraction_method": "pymupdf"
    }
  },
  {
    "element_type": "paragraph",
    "text": "the entire device lifecycle — from provisioning through scheduling, monitoring, and servicing — into a",
    "page": 3,
    "heading_level": null,
    "heading_path": [
      "COMPANY PROFILE",
      "2.​Business Context"
    ],
    "metadata": {
      "extraction_method": "pymupdf"
    }
  },
  {
    "element_type": "paragraph",
    "text": "single, purpose-built mobile app.",
    "page": 3,
    "heading_level": null,
    "heading_path": [
      "COMPANY PROFILE",
      "2.​Business Context"
    ],
    "metadata": {
      "extraction_method": "pymupdf"
    }
  },
